<% content_for :title, "Privacy Policy | Muchea Stockfeed & Hardware" %>
<% content_for :description, "Privacy Policy for Muchea Stockfeed & Hardware (Muchea Trading Pty Ltd). Explaining how personal information is handled in accordance with the Privacy Act 1988 (Cth)." %>

<div class="bg-brand-dark text-white py-12 border-b-4 border-brand-primary">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-primary uppercase tracking-widest">Data Protection &amp; Confidentiality</span>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black font-serif-brand mt-1">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-300 mt-2 max-w-2xl">
      How <strong>Muchea Trading Pty Ltd</strong> (ABN 56 700 841 550 • ACN 700 841 550) protects and respects your personal information under Australian Privacy Law.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
  <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-sm space-y-8 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed">
    
    <div class="text-xs text-stone-500 pb-4 border-b border-stone-100">
      Effective Date: <%= Date.today.strftime("%B %Y") %> • In compliance with the Australian Privacy Principles (APPs)
    </div>

    <!-- Section 1 -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 font-serif-brand border-b border-stone-100 pb-2">1. Our Commitment to Your Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Muchea Trading Pty Ltd</strong> trading as <strong>Muchea Stockfeed &amp; Hardware</strong> ("we", "us", "our") is dedicated to protecting the privacy of our rural customers, members, and website visitors. We comply with the <em>Privacy Act 1988 (Cth)</em> and the Australian Privacy Principles (APPs).
      </p>
      <div class="p-3.5 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 text-xs">
        <p><strong>Entity:</strong> Muchea Trading Pty Ltd (ABN 56 700 841 550 • ACN 700 841 550)</p>
        <p><strong>Address:</strong> 17b Edwards Pl, Muchea WA 6501</p>
        <p><strong>Contact:</strong> sales@mucheastockfeed.com.au | (08) 9571 8840</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 2 -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 font-serif-brand border-b border-stone-100 pb-2">2. What Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you browse our store, create a rural member account, submit a contact inquiry, or place an order, we may collect:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 pl-2 text-stone-600">
        <li><strong>Contact Details:</strong> Your full name, telephone number, mobile number, and email address;</li>
        <li><strong>Property &amp; Delivery Address:</strong> Paddock, property name, road address, Western Australian postcode, and drop-off notes (e.g. gate access codes or machinery shed locations);</li>
        <li><strong>Transaction Data:</strong> Product orders, quantities, dates, delivery zone selections, and tax invoice history;</li>
        <li><strong>Technical Information:</strong> IP address, device type, browser information, and session cookies necessary for cart functionality.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 3 -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 font-serif-brand border-b border-stone-100 pb-2">3. Payment Information &amp; PCI-DSS Security</h2>
      <p>
        We treat the security of your payment details with extreme priority:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 pl-2 text-stone-600">
        <li>All card payments are processed securely through <strong>Stripe Australia Pty Ltd</strong>, a certified PCI-DSS Level 1 Service Provider.</li>
        <li>Your credit or debit card numbers, CVC security codes, and sensitive financial data are transmitted directly to Stripe over end-to-end 256-bit SSL encryption.</li>
        <li><strong>Muchea Stockfeed &amp; Hardware never stores or views your complete credit card numbers on our servers.</strong></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 4 -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 font-serif-brand border-b border-stone-100 pb-2">4. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>
        We collect and use your personal information solely for legitimate agricultural supply business operations, including:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 pl-2 text-stone-600">
        <li>Processing your order and coordinating delivery runs via our Muchea rural truck fleet;</li>
        <li>Sending order status updates, dispatch notifications, and ATO-compliant tax invoices;</li>
        <li>Reviewing trade member account applications;</li>
        <li>Responding to product, hay, or quote inquiries submitted through our website or phone lines;</li>
        <li>Complying with Australian taxation, accounting, and legal requirements.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We <strong>never sell, rent, or trade your personal information</strong> to third-party marketing companies.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 5 -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 font-serif-brand border-b border-stone-100 pb-2">5. Third-Party Service Providers</h2>
      <p>
        We only disclose necessary personal data to trusted service providers who assist our operations under strict confidentiality obligations:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 pl-2 text-stone-600">
        <li><strong>Payment Processors:</strong> Stripe Australia for secure card processing;</li>
        <li><strong>Logistics Drivers:</strong> Our local warehouse drivers and fleet dispatchers to locate your property;</li>
        <li><strong>Transactional Email Providers:</strong> To deliver invoice receipts and shipment tracking codes.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 6 -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 font-serif-brand border-b border-stone-100 pb-2">6. Accessing &amp; Correcting Your Information</h2>
      <p>
        Under the Australian Privacy Principles, you have the right to request access to any personal information we hold about you, or ask us to update or correct it.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can review and edit your address details by logging into your member account or by emailing us at <a href="mailto:sales@mucheastockfeed.com.au" class="text-brand-primary underline">sales@mucheastockfeed.com.au</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 7 -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 font-serif-brand border-b border-stone-100 pb-2">7. Contact Our Privacy Officer</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions, feedback, or complaints regarding how we manage your personal information, please contact:
      </p>
      <div class="p-3.5 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 text-xs">
        <p><strong>Privacy Officer — Muchea Trading Pty Ltd</strong></p>
        <p>Address: 17b Edwards Pl, Muchea WA 6501</p>
        <p>Email: <a href="mailto:sales@mucheastockfeed.com.au" class="text-brand-primary underline">sales@mucheastockfeed.com.au</a></p>
        <p>Phone: (08) 9571 8840</p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</div>
